@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5113
@token =

### 200 登录成功
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 400 参数错误（缺少 password）
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin"
}

### 401 密码错误
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### 401 未登录（不带 Token）
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/auth/me

### 401 未登录（Token 无效）
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

### 200 获取当前用户（需先登录复制 token）
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 可访问菜单
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/auth/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 商品列表
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/Products?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 库存列表
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 按商品名称或条码查询库存
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory?page=1&size=10&keyword=薯片
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 按商品编号查询库存
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 按库存编号查询详情
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 库存预警列表
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory/warning?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 库存流水列表
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory/records?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 按流水类型查询
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory/records?page=1&size=10&recordType=销售
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 管理员手动增加库存
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "changeQty": 10,
  "recordType": "手动入库",
  "sourceNo": "MANUAL-TEST-001",
  "remark": "接口测试增加库存"
}

### 409 扣减数量超过当前库存
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "changeQty": -999999,
  "recordType": "手动出库",
  "remark": "测试库存不足"
}

### 400 变动数量不能为 0
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "changeQty": 0,
  "recordType": "盘点",
  "remark": "测试非法数量"
}

### 401 未登录不能查询库存
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/inventory?page=1&size=10
